<section class="lsu-scope-sponsorship phero spons-hero">
<div class="lsu-scope-sponsorship spons-hero-bg">
</div>
<div class="lsu-scope-sponsorship phero-copy">
<div class="kicker lsu-scope-sponsorship">Partner with Last Soul Ultra · Stream · Social · On site</div>
<h1 class="lsu-scope-sponsorship">Emotion you can’t buy.<br class="lsu-scope-sponsorship">Presence you can.</h1>
<p class="lsu-scope-sponsorship">A 24/7 livestream over days, millions on social, a camp only partners get into. Nothing staged. Everything felt.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section class="lsu-scope-sponsorship section">
<div class="lsu-scope-sponsorship shell why">
<div class="lsu-scope-sponsorship">
<div class="kicker lsu-scope-sponsorship">Why brands are here</div>
<h2 class="h2 lsu-scope-sponsorship why-title">Nothing in sport<br class="lsu-scope-sponsorship">holds people like this</h2>
</div>
<div class="lsu-scope-sponsorship why-copy">
<p class="lsu-scope-sponsorship">A football match is 90 minutes. A marathon is a morning. Last Soul Ultra takes days and nights, and nobody knows when it ends: <a href="/format">one 6.7 km loop every hour until one runner is left</a>. Every hour a start, a fight and a cut.</p>
<p class="lsu-scope-sponsorship why-dim">So people don’t check in. They stay, because they won’t miss the moment it happens. A format like no other. And your brand is there the entire time: in the experience, the emotion, the moments that change an athlete’s life.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="lsu-scope-sponsorship shell they">
<div class="card lsu-scope-sponsorship">
<div class="card-name lsu-scope-sponsorship">They stay</div>
<div class="card-body lsu-scope-sponsorship">25:50 minutes average view time on a livestream. 6.6 views per viewer. People came back again and again for 100 hours.</div>
</div>
<div class="card lsu-scope-sponsorship">
<div class="card-name lsu-scope-sponsorship">They feel</div>
<div class="card-body lsu-scope-sponsorship">979,308 reactions. 263,000 chat messages across YouTube and Twitch. 98.9% positive. No script, no safe ending, real people breaking and holding on.</div>
</div>
<div class="card lsu-scope-sponsorship">
<div class="card-name lsu-scope-sponsorship">They remember</div>
<div class="card-body lsu-scope-sponsorship">Emotion builds memory. A brand that is there at 3 a.m. on night three isn’t a sponsor. It’s part of the feeling.</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
