<section class="lsu-scope-sponsorship section">
<div class="lsu-scope-sponsorship shell why">
<div class="lsu-scope-sponsorship">
<div class="kicker lsu-scope-sponsorship">They don’t watch. They stay.</div>
<h2 class="h2 lsu-scope-sponsorship why-title">As the field shrinks,<br class="lsu-scope-sponsorship">the audience grows</h2>
</div>
<div class="lsu-scope-sponsorship why-copy">
<p class="lsu-scope-sponsorship">The field shrinks every day. And with every runner who drops, more people tune in to see who’s left. On YouTube and on Twitch, day five had the biggest audience of the whole race.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="lsu-scope-sponsorship shell statrows">
<div class="lsu-scope-sponsorship statrow">
<div class="lsu-scope-sponsorship statrow-v">8.0M</div>
<div class="lsu-scope-sponsorship statrow-l">livestream views on YouTube and Twitch in one race week</div>
</div>
<div class="lsu-scope-sponsorship statrow">
<div class="accent lsu-scope-sponsorship statrow-v">1.54M</div>
<div class="lsu-scope-sponsorship statrow-l">unique viewers who found the stream and came back, 6.6 times on average</div>
</div>
<div class="lsu-scope-sponsorship statrow">
<div class="lsu-scope-sponsorship statrow-v">25:50</div>
<div class="lsu-scope-sponsorship statrow-l">minutes average view time, on a livestream that ran 100 hours without a gap</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="growth lsu-scope-sponsorship shell why">
<div class="lsu-scope-sponsorship">
<div class="kicker lsu-scope-sponsorship">Season 1 → Season 2</div>
<h2 class="h2 lsu-scope-sponsorship why-title">Year one built the base.<br class="lsu-scope-sponsorship">Year two redefined the sport</h2>
</div>
<div class="lsu-scope-sponsorship why-copy">
<p class="lsu-scope-sponsorship">The first edition already made national headlines. The second one, <a href="/results">94 yards over four days and nights</a>, tripled the watch time, nearly tripled the peak audience, added Twitch as a second home and put the race on RTL Aktuell and Tagesschau. No other backyard race in the world has been watched like this.</p>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="lsu-scope-sponsorship section">
<div class="lsu-scope-sponsorship shell why">
<div class="lsu-scope-sponsorship">
<div class="kicker lsu-scope-sponsorship">Reach</div>
<h2 class="h2 lsu-scope-sponsorship why-title">One race.<br class="lsu-scope-sponsorship">A whole network</h2>
</div>
<div class="lsu-scope-sponsorship why-copy">
<p class="lsu-scope-sponsorship">The stream is only the centre. Around it: the Last Soul Ultra account, Kim Gottwald’s channels, rappid., and the athletes telling the same race from their own tent.</p>
<p class="lsu-scope-sponsorship">Several million followers across the network, all in endurance, performance and mental strength. Exactly the audience you’re looking for. No wasted impressions.</p>
</div>
</div>
