<h2 class="h2 lsu-scope-sponsorship why-title">Products aren’t placed.<br class="lsu-scope-sponsorship">They’re used</h2>
</div>
<div class="lsu-scope-sponsorship why-copy">
<p class="lsu-scope-sponsorship">Nobody performs for the camera at hour 70. What the stream shows is what actually happens: the poncho in the storm, the drink at 3 a.m., the recovery in the tent, the shoes on loop 94. That’s the difference between an ad and a memory.</p>
